package ui

// Join wraps its children in a DaisyUI `join` container, grouping sibling
// elements (typically buttons) into a connected visual unit. Child elements must
// carry the `join-item` class — use `ui.Button` with `Class: "join-item"` for
// each item inside.
//
// This is the anti-corruption wrapper for DaisyUI's `join` component class so
// page/fragment templates never inline it directly (ai/htmx-conventions.md §"Styling").
templ Join() {
	<div class="join">
		{ children... }
	</div>
}
